  "text": "for Startups, Inc. | Growth Industry Support Platform Centered on Talent Support for Startups 無料転職相談 About Us About Us Mission, Vision, and Values CEO Message Our Business Services Company News Track Record Careers Investor Relations JP EN All for Japan's Growth. All for Startups. All for Japan's Growth. All for Startups. Since our founding in September 2016, for Startups, Inc. has been driven by a singular mission: to create globally competitive industries, companies, services, and talent that power Japan's growth. Guided by our vision of \"for Startups,\" we develop businesses that support high-growth industries. Through talent solutions (Human Capital), exit support (M&A advisory), and Hybrid Capital that recycles value into further financial support—all to build a thriving startup ecosystem. NEWS News View All News Enter section description here. STARTUP DB 2026-10-09 「東洋経済オンライン」に、「STARTUP DB」がデータ提供いたしました アクセラレーション 2026-10-06 フォースタートアップス、新たに２自治体のスタートアップ支援事業に採択 スタートアップM&A仲介 2026-10-06 「スタートアップによるスタートアップ買収戦略」 メドレー・SmartHR・freeeが語る、M&Aの推進体制・PMI・AI活用の現実解 - 「M&A for Startups」ミニカンファレンス vol. 3 開催レポート SERVICES Services View All Services Since our founding in 2016, for Startups, Inc. has built a Growth Industry Support Platform centered on talent solutions for startups. We offer a comprehensive suite of services that empower startups and innovators—spanning talent solutions, exit support, funding, proprietary data, and community building. Human Capital Specialized talent solutions for startups and growth industries. Scaling companies through executive hiring, VC partnerships, and strategic consulting. Startup M&A Advisory Advise startups on strategic M&A, guiding exit strategies and inorganic growth through roll-ups. for Startups Capital Fuel startup growth through hybrid capital investment, pairing strategic talent acquisition with direct equity funding. STARTUP DB One of Japan’s largest information platforms dedicated to high-growth industries. Unlocking startup and investor data to drive collaboration, funding, and M&A. Acceleration Partner with government, academia and industry leaders to co-create startup programs that spark innovation. GRIC Host GRIC—Japan’s largest conference for growth industries. convening 10,000+ founders, investors, and enterprise leaders for co-creation. SUCCESS STORIES Track Record View All Track Records Enter section description here. No items found. RECRUIT We are looking for people to join us on the front lines of supporting growth industries. Careers TOP About Us Mission, Vision, and Values Message from the CEO Our Business Services Human Capital Startup M&A Advisory for Startups Capital STARTUP DB Acceleration GRIC Company News Track Record Careers Work Environment Investor Relations IR News Management Policy Financial Highlights IR Library For Individual Investors Stock Information IR Calendar IR FAQs Disclaimer Disclosure Policy Free Career Consultation Contact Us Anti-Harassment Policy Privacy Policy Scope of Services © for Startups, Inc. All rights Reserved.",
